  "body": "Positioned on an elevated 295sqm freehold site, this well-presented executive home offers space, privacy and excellent sun in a convenient Orakei location. Tucked away at the rear of three homes with an elevated position, offering extra privacy.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 222sqm of floor area, the home is designed for comfortable family living, with generous proportions and plenty of natural light throughout. It provides a pleasant outlook, while the flat backyard offers practical outdoor space for entertaining, children or gardening.\r\n\r\nA striking entrance with high-stud doors opens into a spacious foyer, setting the tone for the home’s open and welcoming layout.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Elevated 295sqm freehold site \r\n• Approx. 222sqm floor area with generous living spaces\r\n• 5 bedrooms with multiple living areas for flexible family living\r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n• Seamless indoor–outdoor flow to entertaining spaces\r\n• Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n• Balcony off the living area to enjoy the sunshine and city views\r\n• Flat backyard – ideal for kids, pets or outdoor gatherings\r\n• Internal-access garage plus additional storage\r\n\r\nLocated in the popular Orakei area, the home is just minutes from Mission Bay and Kohimarama beaches, with Eastridge Shopping Centre, local cafés, parks and schools all nearby. The CBD is also within easy reach, making daily commuting simple.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for an elevated, sunny home with practical outdoor space and privacy, this property is well worth inspecting. Call me today to arrange your viewing.",
